      "arabic": "١١٩٦٧- أم حبيبة بنت أبي سفيان «٣»:\nصخر بن حرب بن أمية القرشية الأموية، زوج النبي ﵌، واسمها رملة. تقدمت في الأسماء.",
      "english": "11967—Umm Habiba bint Abi Sufyan:(3)\n\nAbu Sufyan was Sakhr ibn Harb ibn Umayya. She was Qurashi, of the Umayyad clan, and was the wife of the Prophet, may Allah bless him and grant him peace. Her name was Ramlah. She has already appeared in the section on names.",
